{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43011","headline":"洛阳河亭奉酬留守郡公追送 · 李逸","name":"洛阳河亭奉酬留守郡公追送","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"离亭饯落晖，腊酒减征衣。\n岁晚烟霞重，川寒云树微。\n戎装千里至，旧路十年归。\n还似汀洲雁，相逢又背飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李逸","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43011.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43011","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}